      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Reference image to video**\n\nA reference picture keeps the same character, product or style in a new scene.\n\n1. **Load Image** holds the reference picture. A sample still is loaded, so you can press **Run** right away.\n2. **Reference Pack** passes it on. For several pictures of one character, type a folder path into **image_folder**.\n3. In the prompt, call the pictures **Image 1**, **Image 2** and so on, and describe the new scene.\n4. Press **Run**.\n\nReferences cannot be combined with a first or last frame.\n\n**First time?** Paste your HashBidX key into the **HashBidX API Key** box above and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key, and every template is ready to run."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "**Reference image to video**\n\nA reference picture keeps the same character, product or style in a new scene.\n\n1. **Load Image** holds the reference picture. A sample still is loaded, so you can press **Run** right away.\n2. **Reference Pack** passes it on. For several pictures of one character, type a folder path into **image_folder**.\n3. In the prompt, call the pictures **Image 1**, **Image 2** and so on, and describe the new scene.\n4. Press **Run**.\n\nReferences cannot be combined with a first or last frame.\n\n**First time?** Paste your HashBidX key into the **HashBidX API Key** box above and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key, and every template is ready to run."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
